Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Comment: 0,0:00:33.39,0:00:33.39,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:03.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.28,0:02:17.24,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I found an interesting spot in this town!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.62,0:02:19.29,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,A place called Lake Grrrm.{zugogo-ko}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.79,0:02:21.20,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Lake Grrrm?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.20,0:02:22.75,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Weird name.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.75,0:02:28.50,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Apparently, it’s called that because the ground \N will start rumbling like “grrrrm” out of nowhere.{zugogogo~}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.50,0:02:30.76,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ooh... Sounds interesting!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.76,0:02:33.13,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Sounds like you could \N get a vid out of that!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.55,0:02:35.13,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I was thinking the same thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.47,0:02:40.89,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Stop, stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.43,0:02:45.69,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,You can’t go running around \N all covered in cream, you guys!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.31,0:02:48.56,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya, we need you!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.20,0:03:00.41,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Thanks, Masquernya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.24,0:03:02.20,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.62,0:03:08.17,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,What was all the uproar about?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.17,0:03:08.84,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.21,0:03:14.47,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I was working on coming up with \N a new sweets recipe, but those Sharitatsu...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.30,0:03:20.93,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,...kept getting in my way, like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.51,0:03:24.43,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I {\i1}told{\i0} you not to sit on the plates!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.69,0:03:30.98,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Can’t exactly focus \N on cooking like that...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.98,0:03:32.36,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.36,0:03:34.07,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.07,0:03:37.07,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Why don’t we take the Sharitatsu \N with us to Lake Grrrm?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.07,0:03:37.66,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.28,0:03:42.58,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I’m thinking they might need to \N work off some excess energy.
Comment: 10,0:03:43.37,0:03:44.04,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.04,0:03:46.08,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I see. Yeah, that could be it!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.08,0:03:50.33,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s bring ‘em along.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.09,0:03:58.89,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I told you not to sit on the plates...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.86,0:04:23.20,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Lake Grrrm sure is pretty, huh?{lit. Lake Grrrm’s one pretty lake, huh?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.70,0:04:25.16,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,But y’know...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.87,0:04:32.08,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I don’t hear any rumbling.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.38,0:04:34.92,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.92,0:04:41.34,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,The info online says the “grrrrm” sound \N comes from near that big boulder.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.89,0:04:50.23,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I still can’t hear anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.23,0:04:52.02,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,All made up, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.02,0:04:54.44,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Well, it happens.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.40,0:04:58.15,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.15,0:04:59.78,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s rumbling!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.03,0:05:05.66,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I can hear it from in here!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.91,0:05:08.66,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That’s no rock!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.66,0:05:09.79,Main,Liko Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.25,0:05:12.50,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That’s...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.26,0:05:24.72,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,A Heirassha!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.10,0:05:27.97,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}It’s huge!{\i0}{Dread Heirassha}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.64,0:05:34.94,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,Heirassha. Big Catfish Pokémon. \N Water type.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.94,0:05:39.49,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,It has a massive body and strength, \N but apparently is not very smart.{Mix of Z/A + Violet dex entries}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.49,0:05:41.07,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.45,0:05:50.00,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Hey, maybe this little one...{kono ko}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.30,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hey! Look out!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.30,0:05:59.76,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You’re gonna get flattened!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.85,0:06:08.85,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You got a mega-tiny voice!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.10,0:06:14.85,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,H-Huh? It ran away?{Dread Heirassha}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.74,0:06:26.45,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I see, so that’s it...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.45,0:06:29.12,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,That Heirassha’s a mega-scaredy-cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.12,0:06:30.95,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Seems like it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.95,0:06:34.71,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,But then, what was it doing up on land?{Dread Heirassha}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.71,0:06:37.54,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It’d be safer in the lake.{Dread Heirassha}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.54,0:06:39.75,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Maybe it was sunbathing?{Dread Heirassha}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.75,0:06:42.76,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Feels like there’s gotta be \N {\i1}some{\i0} reason...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.32,0:07:07.57,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Is that...?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.16,0:07:15.50,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,Migaluza. Jettison Pokémon. \N Water/Esper type.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.50,0:07:17.54,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,It has excellent regenerative capabilities.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.54,0:07:22.13,Main,Smartphone Rotom,0,0,0,,It sheds spare flesh from its body \N to become nimbler, then charges its prey.{Violet dex entry}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.64,0:07:32.77,Main,Roy Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.70,0:07:54.54,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Now I see what’s going on...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.54,0:07:59.17,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,That Migaluza scared Heirassha, \N and it fled onto land.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.05,0:08:14.43,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,And the rumbling that gave Lake Grrrm its name \N was the sound of Heirassha trembling in fear.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.02,0:08:17.35,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Still, you’re pretty darn pitiful, ain’tcha?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.69,0:08:23.94,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Your voice’s even mega-tinier \N than before!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.94,0:08:27.32,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Hey, just throwing out ideas...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.32,0:08:31.49,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What if this little one \N hasn’t been getting enough to eat?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.49,0:08:35.04,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,If Migaluza’s always \N chasing it around like that...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.33,0:08:43.54,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That was the last straw...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.51,0:08:53.39,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ooh, the Sharitatsu \N went off to get back at it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.39,0:08:58.43,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That pace is crazy!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.43,0:09:01.56,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Yeah! They might just have this, maybe...!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.40,0:09:11.28,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Run, Sharitatsu!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.41,0:09:20.66,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.66,0:09:22.08,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.08,0:09:23.92,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,They got eaten!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.42,0:09:34.55,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Sharitatsu... H-Hey...!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.85,0:09:40.10,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,They... came out with sparkly eyes?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.78,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Everyone out!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.70,0:10:00.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?! They’re not coming out!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.71,0:10:11.63,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I see. A mean Migaluza \N and a frightened Heirassha, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.63,0:10:13.09,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Yup, exactly!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.09,0:10:13.80,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.39,0:10:17.81,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,How come these guys’ eyes \N are all sparkly?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.81,0:10:21.98,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,They’ve been like that ever since \N they crawled into Heirassha’s mouth.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.98,0:10:24.02,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,We don’t really know why.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.98,0:10:25.69,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ahh!{This was grouped with the next line in the captions, but it sounds more like Ult than Roy to me}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.69,0:10:28.40,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,You can’t just sit on plates like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.94,0:10:31.19,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,And speaking of things we don’t know...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.19,0:10:35.32,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,How come these Sharitatsu \N want to sit on plates?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.32,0:10:38.95,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Oh, these guys have been \N like this for a long time.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.37,0:10:40.70,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,A long time?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.29,0:10:45.75,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I don’t know if you remember, \N but I almost told you once, yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.50,0:10:51.63,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Are they your Pokémon, Murdock?{068}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.38,0:10:55.43,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,It’s a lot more complicated \N with these guys.{068}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.43,0:10:58.01,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,{\t(1977,2477,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}It’s a pretty long story, but...{068}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.51,0:11:01.02,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Oh, that complicated story \N you mentioned...?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.60,0:11:07.52,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I met these guys after I left Kaede-san’s, \N while I was working part-time at a sushi place.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.52,0:11:11.32,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s when we were \N on our Terastal Course.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.32,0:11:11.90,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.90,0:11:15.45,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Wait... Murdock, \N you worked at a sushi place, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.45,0:11:16.20,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Sure did!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.20,0:11:17.32,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Whoa, awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.32,0:11:19.49,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I want sushi for breakfast tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.49,0:11:20.99,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi likes ginger!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.99,0:11:22.45,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,No wasabi on mine!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.45,0:11:25.16,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Wait, Roy, don’t you {\i1}love{\i} spicy food?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.16,0:11:27.63,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Wasabi’s a bit too much for me...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.08,0:11:29.50,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi ginger!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.50,0:11:33.38,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,H-Hold on a second, guys. \N Let’s slow down.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.38,0:11:36.43,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Hearing Murdock out \N comes before our sushi orders.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.26,0:11:39.51,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Yeah, sounds good.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.51,0:11:41.26,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Originally, those Sharitatsu...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.06,0:11:45.23,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,...were the mascot Pokémon \N for that sushi restaurant.{kanban pokemon in previous eps: mascot Pokémon}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.52,0:11:50.52,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,Hey, order up!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.45,0:11:58.24,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,Hey! Sharitatsu!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.24,0:12:01.41,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,How many times I gotta tell ya, \N don’t lie there!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.53,0:12:05.58,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought it was Sharitatsu, \N but it’s just sushi.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.58,0:12:07.12,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,No problem, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.42,0:12:10.04,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,{\i1}‘Course{\i0} there’s a problem!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.04,0:12:11.63,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,Murryboy, sushi-oke!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.04,0:12:12.96,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.71,0:12:16.55,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.68,0:12:24.10,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,Okay, okay! \N For an {\i1}oke,{\i0} that is.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.52,0:12:25.81,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,Just a little jest.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.69,0:12:32.23,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Boss, this counter...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.23,0:12:33.69,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,Ain’t it neat?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.69,0:12:37.70,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,I partially remodeled this place \N for the Sharitatsu!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.78,0:12:47.00,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Whoop...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.46,0:12:50.54,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,That’s why you shouldn’t sit on those...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.09,0:12:58.55,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Then, when I eventually left \N to return to the Brave Asagi...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.55,0:13:01.51,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,Traveling around the world...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.51,0:13:02.89,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.89,0:13:07.06,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,Then Murryboy, \N couldja take these guys with ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.06,0:13:08.18,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.89,0:13:11.27,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,This place... \N It’s too cramped for ‘em.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.73,0:13:14.82,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,These guys’re hidin’ \N far, far more amazin’ power.{needs some sort of contraction/stand-out, quoted in old-man later}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.82,0:13:17.69,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,I want ‘em to be able to let it all out.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.69,0:13:21.82,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,There’s gotta be a true home for ‘em \N somewhere out there!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.41,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,I beg ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.41,0:13:28.83,Main,Sushi Chef,0,0,0,,Let ‘em see {needs some sort of contraction/stand-out}dat big ol’ world!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.67,0:13:37.46,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Boss... You’ve been a huge help.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.51,0:13:50.23,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,And so, I returned with the Sharitatsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.23,0:13:54.10,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,So that’s what happened...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.10,0:13:57.98,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,So, why exactly \N do they like sitting on plates?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.98,0:13:59.15,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.57,0:14:01.61,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,No idea!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.53,0:14:03.11,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.24,0:14:08.49,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,But still... \N The boss’s wish is my wish.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.08,0:14:13.37,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I wanna find these guys \N their perfect home.
Comment: 0,0:14:22.47,0:14:22.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.47,0:15:14.98,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,So this is the Heirassha \N you were talking about.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.61,0:15:22.32,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Looks like the Sharitatsu \N are pretty buddy-buddy with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.32,0:15:24.95,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,They’re really trying to \N get in its mouth...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.20,0:15:32.95,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,And there’s the mean Migaluza.
Comment: 10,0:15:53.31,0:15:54.14,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.14,0:15:56.64,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,One of ‘em finally \N jumped in its mouth!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.73,0:16:01.57,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Could it be...?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.59,0:16:29.72,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Gah... Nothing’s even happened yet, \N but it’s already scared outta its mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.03,0:16:50.91,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It bounced it back?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.79,0:17:02.96,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I see... That’s right!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.14,0:17:16.18,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,It’s fast!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.18,0:17:17.72,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,All right! It can outrun it!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.07,0:17:31.20,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Migaluza sped up, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.20,0:17:32.74,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,That’s mega-bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.83,0:17:38.58,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Ahh...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.84,0:17:50.84,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Aaah! It’s gonna get bullied again!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.62,0:18:20.62,Main,Liko Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.62,0:18:21.50,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.50,0:18:23.00,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Mega-cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.00,0:18:24.67,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,What’s going on?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.67,0:18:28.13,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,The Sharitatsu have been \N sitting on things...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.42,0:18:31.84,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,...because they’ve always been \N looking for a {\i1}home.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.80,0:18:37.35,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,A home to see {sushi managerese}dat big ol’ world from!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.72,0:18:40.22,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,So then, maybe that’s...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.22,0:18:43.85,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,...their true home? \N Being with Heirassha?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.23,0:18:48.36,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Got it. Then how about you...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.69,0:18:54.99,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,...hit it with everything you’ve got?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.87,0:18:59.12,Main,Liko Navi,0,0,0,,Heirassha!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.12,0:19:00.49,Main,Roy Ult,0,0,0,,Sharitatsu!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.12,0:19:05.46,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Sharitatsu... Show me that \N {managerese}amazin’ power the boss mentioned!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.71,0:19:13.59,Main,Them,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.06,0:19:25.10,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Order up!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.06,0:19:31.15,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That was an amazing battle.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.11,0:19:36.61,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,It won’t be picking on it again.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.61,0:19:41.91,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah. Now I bet Heirassha will be able \N to eat whenever it wants, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.12,0:19:46.16,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Well, ‘bout time \N we get back to the ship, eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.16,0:19:48.38,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’re you gonna do \N with the Sharitatsu?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.59,0:19:57.88,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Here. The new sweets.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.88,0:20:01.64,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Without your mischief-making, \N I finished them in no time.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.10,0:20:09.19,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I’m glad you got to \N make such a wonderful friend!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.19,0:20:10.40,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Look after yourselves!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.40,0:20:13.23,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,That battle before was mega-cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.23,0:20:15.07,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,You guys stay out of trouble, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.07,0:20:16.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh, a goodbye?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.45,0:20:23.58,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.58,0:20:32.25,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Wait, why’re you following me?! \N That was building up to a {\i1}perfect{\i0} bye-bye scene!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.25,0:20:34.71,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Why’d ya go and follow after me?!
Comment: 10,0:20:42.14,0:20:43.60,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.31,0:20:47.98,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,And then the Sharitatsu \N are just nowhere to be seen!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.56,0:20:53.32,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,What’s with those guys... \N Weren’t they gonna get back on the ship?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.19,0:20:54.94,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.69,0:20:56.44,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.03,0:20:59.74,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Everywhere’s all clean...?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.03,0:21:02.87,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,Who could’ve done this...?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.74,0:21:06.41,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Oh! Couldn’t it be the Sharitatsu?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.75,0:21:15.71,Main,Murdock,0,0,0,,I get it... “A rice{shari} leaving{tatsu} \N the nest leaves no mess” huh...?{A departing bird(tori) doesn't muddy what it leaves.; a proverb, don't leave a bad impression behind you, with tori swapped for shari}
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.70,0:21:48.25,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.25,0:21:51.92,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.42,0:21:55.59,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Heirassha!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.59,0:21:57.96,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It follows Sharitatsu \N like an admired boss...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.96,0:22:02.72,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,...and has a massive body and strength, \N but do you know what other trait it has?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.09,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.36,0:23:42.32,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.32,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.74,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,B: It’s a big eater!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:46.20,0:23:50.24,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It works together with Sharitatsu \N to satisfy its bottomless appetite!
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.04,0:24:04.21,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,{Liko lines sound like quoting movie taglines or something}The time has come \N for two heroes to face off!{phrasing too common to even pin down a source, if there even is one}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.34,0:24:06.80,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Two heroes?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.80,0:24:08.34,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Mighty G’s not the only one?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.34,0:24:12.85,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Friend or foe, \N there are two things you need in life!{Seem to be various phrasings, everything I need in life I learned from heroes/from JoJo, there are only three/infinite things you need in life}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.14,0:24:16.73,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Don’t miss a new {hero legend}heroic legend!{Seems like possibly Kamen Rider -> hero, from a Kamen Rider phrase}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.10,0:24:20.31,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.31,0:24:23.94,Main,Dandy H,0,0,0,,Arriving With Charisma! Dandy H!!{A Splendid/Magnificent Arrival!, where magnificent is a homonym for curry.}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.94,0:24:25.24,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Dandy H?!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:25.24,0:24:28.66,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Behind that mask, \N could it possibly be...?!
